==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (400%) spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage can prove to be difficult for some players thanks to the Shy Boys. If you have crowd controller units like [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Sorceress Cat]] or [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer Cat]], as well as some attackers like your general ranged units or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Sword Master Cat]] to deal with them. Consider attacking the base and leading the Shy Boys closer to you if you find yourself struggling.

